{"availability":"available","full":"SaarthurR/atticus-mac","name":"atticus-mac","description":"Fast, free voice assistant for your Mac. No API key: runs on your Claude Pro or Max plan. Sends background agents for big jobs, remembers you and learns your shortcuts. Hold ⌃⌥Space and talk.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":180,"forks":7,"created":"2026-10-10T01:07:04Z","updated":"2026-10-16T03:53:07Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://saarthurr.github.io/atticus-mac/","topics":["claude","claude-code","macos","menubar-app","open-source","productivity","speech-recognition","swift","voice-assistant"],"demo":"https://saarthurr.github.io/atticus-mac/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:03:17.135Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T05:03:17.135Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T05:03:17.135Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:03:17.135Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T02:00:42.647Z","stars":5,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T05:03:17.135Z","stars":180,"forks":7}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Hold ⌃ control ⌥ option space, say what you need, let go.","Atticus moves your windows, finds your files, reads your screen and gets it done.","⚡ Fast · 🔑 No API key · 🧠 Remembers you · Free and open source"],"features":["Fast. Simple asks skip the AI: an app opens in 0.08 s. Ask for an action once and Atticus learns it, so next time it runs in a blink, with no AI and for free.","No API key. It runs on the Claude Pro or Max plan you already have, through Claude Code — or on your Devin plan through the Devin CLI (Settings → AI client). Nothing to sign up for, no key to paste, no extra bill.","Remembers you. Say \"remember…\" and every ask after that knows it. It picks up who you are (your name, your apps) and fixes its own mistakes when you correct it."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SaarthurR/atticus-mac/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d4c1ba13071a89eca3d3b5a63